WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.546
Kẽerã sẽn fãag nin-buiida. Yaa kassena lagem-n-taar.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:20.354
A Abem ra yaa zĩm-biisi, la a yaa Kassena zakã yaab. A ra zãada a boog n loogda, wa a sẽn da maand daar fãa wã.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.786
La kom-kãsengã kɩtame tɩ weoogã yõog bugum. B ra pa le yãgdẽ ye.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.818
A Abem ra tũuda nin-buiida, n paasdẽ. La a sẽn wa n bas-a wã, a pa le mi bũmb ye.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.208
Wĩndgã dag n zẽkame, tɩ ko-yũud yõk a Zezi.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.362
A wa n zẽka a gãagã. A ra pa tar bũmb ye.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.136
A sã n da ket n kẽnd bilfu, a lʋɩame.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:43.394
Bũmb n da kẽnd weoogẽ wã. Koɛɛg sẽn zãr ne koomã.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:59.858
A Abɛem ra baood n na n dɩka a boogã, la b nugã ka leb n sak-a ye. A ninga a ninã.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:17.338
Ko-kãnga pa wãbd ye. A zẽka-a-la ne sũ-bʋgsem.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:33.554
A Abem yikame. La bõn-bilã kolgame, n wẽnemd a meng n yeel-a t'a tũ-m.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:55.960
Kẽer poore, koomã ra pida ne koom sẽn yaa vẽenega.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:04.928
La a Abɛem yũu rãam n lebg n vɩ.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.648
A Zezi leb n wẽnemdame n wõgemd b taoore.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:38.802
D pa na n kʋ bõn-buudã ye. Ne maam bɩ m kambã.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:46.160
A zakã rãmb wẽename.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.792
A pa na n dɩ tõnd sɩda?

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:14.672
Hal baa rũndã-rũndã, kassena neb kẽer ket n getame t'a yaa bõn-sõngo.
